  "releaseNotes": "JsonSerializer:\n      - Remove the custom IBufferWriter (PooledBufferWriter) and related pooling-based JSON helpers.\n      - Deleted src/LuciferCore/Pool/PooledBufferWriter.cs and removed ThreadLocal writer, RentSerialize, DeserializeFromBuffer, and their wrappers in Lucifer.cs and Buffer.cs.\n      - PacketModel now deserializes directly with JsonSerializer.\n      - These changes simplify serialization plumbing by relying on System.Text.Json directly and eliminate the pooled Utf8JsonWriter adapter and helper methods.",
